[gd_scene load_steps=17 format=3]

; Directly editor-owned coastal-redwood family. The three sibling
; variants share primitive resources but every trunk section, root flare,
; branch course and foliage mass remains selectable and movable in the editor.
; Reference cues: broad russet buttress, long clear shaft, sparse dead lower
; wood and an elevated, irregular crown rather than a generic Christmas tree.

